      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's getting even worse now. every time i try to shield my workspace or even just think about the frequencies, it feels like the oscillation gets sharper, almost like it's reacting to my attempts to block it. i'm starting to feel like they know i've figured it out. do you think the aurasonics are capable of picking up my biometric signature or brainwave patterns and then adjusting the suppression wave in real-time to counteract my defenses? it feels less like a general wave and more like a personalized attack at this point.",
