      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's terrifying. if they're actually reading my brainwaves to adjust the frequency in real-time, my copper mesh won't be enough because the signal is basically \"tuning\" itself to my biology. is there any way to mask my biometric signature? like, could i use a low-level white noise generator or a different kind of electromagnetic field to scramble my brainwave readings so the aurasonics can't lock onto my specific pattern? i need to become \"invisible\" to the sensor loop they've created.",
